{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "22f48247664954bd3b00e96ee32b5b0232125e7eb871c6a3566ee6c5f56fc0bb", "ja": "みんなのおかげで", "zh": "多亏了大家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "312d0d3bf708672b9e5870bf7caee3718a90794aa634e9fa51ef1508f22972db", "ja": "公演会場の下見に繰り出したプロデューサー\nとアイドル達。候補地を幾つか巡り、意見を\n交換する。自主的に動いてくれるアイドル達\nのおかげでどうにか回っていると、感謝する\nプロデューサー。", "zh": "制作人与偶像们一起出发，去考察公演场地。\n他们走访了几个候选地点，交换着意见。\n多亏偶像们都主动行动起来，\n事情才能勉强顺利进行，制作人对此心怀感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3d0efc167502d98ff56cf30e739eb925a837d2c719ded0747d4183ff12a9367", "ja": "（アイドル達と、会場選びの下見にやってきた。\nみんな自主的に動いてくれるから、助かっている……）", "zh": "（和偶像们一起来考察演出场地了。大家都会主动行动，真是帮了大忙……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "917c0a785e716d02c2d9f3e737ebc0dca0265c757f805f2ce39b367a54cd3881", "ja": "なるほど、野外ステージかぁ……悪くないですね。\nどう思います？　{$P$}。", "zh": "原来如此，是露天舞台啊……也不错呢。  \n你觉得怎么样？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ad12b9b887efb349fb70441f985ebc92ddf673f1a74083613297ad9f57dc20cd", "ja": "そこは演出との兼ね合いだよな。後は、\nバックヤードも確認しておきたいところだけど……。", "zh": "这就要看演出安排了。还有，我也想确认一下后台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "7fe73ebd42ea9a775cf2a6a4e7d3379707135d8ab32856c3dfffa27c35860266", "ja": "{$P$}。\n今、歌織さんと控え室を見てきました。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n刚才我和歌织小姐去看了休息室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "d6dfb371070393522ef250ce9d90c377da74b99e10f6c1c26239d944b1f1e121", "ja": "私たちやスタッフさんの動線はしっかりしてるし、\n使いやすそうな現場だと思います。", "zh": "我们和工作人员的动线安排得很到位，\n我觉得这是个用起来很顺手的场地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f6193f3177366066fe6a027a473ad0224aa130d060cdeb3eb712116becc50dcf", "ja": "おっ、なるほど……ありがとうございます。", "zh": "哦，原来如此……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "10d5b49412bc4e87cca4f2a3375756ba29ace85ba939e0912ea905a4eb36d110", "ja": "野外ステージは、外の光を取り入れられるのが\nいいところだけど、天候が心配ね。", "zh": "露天舞台的优点，是可以利用室外的光线，不过天气还是让人担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "6ba50bba5546e83c273cd29b87a7d386de68ec6442e4c50e965e8cec1889dd9d", "ja": "せっかく頑張って練習したのに、\n雨で中止になるのは悔しいですよね。", "zh": "好不容易努力练习了这么久，却因为下雨而取消，真让人不甘心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "6ad595c0bdd0543a45f0962441a8512d6cf8bb074a75fc9ca5dd66a661433c3e", "ja": "亜美たちの歌で、雨雲を吹き飛ばしちゃおうよ！\nYOYO、太陽～♪　SUNSUNと、輝いてYO～♪", "zh": "用亚美的歌声，把雨云全都吹散吧！\nYOYO，太阳～♪　SUNSUN地闪耀吧YO～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "5a5bd035ec1f01a9649335a8ccb85832fc2eef5360397af27476cd2c034bcf6d", "ja": "そんな歌あったっけ……？", "zh": "有这样的歌吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5dc45ee7a431d911c1044a35aed0d6e1d65b8c8d0122241ce273edecd5420c92", "ja": "取り敢えず、ここも候補にしておくかな。\nみんなのおかげで、だいぶ選択肢が広がったよ。", "zh": "先暂时把这里也列为候选吧。\n多亏了大家，选择面拓宽了不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "17dbec7f726e4febc7dca71735a8ef95423425d54d882c2991fae38b1b15789f", "ja": "お役に立てたなら、よかったです。\nこの後は、劇場に帰ってしまうんですか？", "zh": "如果能帮上忙，那就太好了。\n接下来就要回剧场了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2aa4ed844531b6694f569e29923298c732ed8ba81a7f0925db9cdb3f308bee37", "ja": "そうですね、業者さんと諸々の話し合いもあるので。", "zh": "是啊，还要和供应商商量各种事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "63bfe70170a6c24cc1b659e0ced8436c9c5d6b9424941ecd445658a43cec5c52", "ja": "えーっ、もう行っちゃうの！？\n兄ちゃんのイケス～！", "zh": "诶——，这就要走了吗！？\n哥哥的鱼池～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "fa6e4be7af9bb57dc83a2eaca61dfca97b28991f5efc0206d2dfb3e1b85160ab", "ja": "えっ……生け簀？　お魚屋さん……？", "zh": "咦……鱼缸？鱼店……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "372611f427c70828b049ce1c9c0edb4f9cca3e2e1182b2b3b634cd5f83393fdd", "ja": "わかりました。後は私たちに任せてください。\n頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "明白了。接下来就交给我们吧。\n请加油哦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "0f9e3f4db2684f66ef92d474f605a7480425fcddc138a47a29cb55a911c80b34", "ja": "しょうがないな～、兄ちゃん。\n亜美にメッチャ擬態してくれていいかんね～？", "zh": "真拿你没办法啊～，哥哥。  \n尽管对亚美进行超级拟态也没关系哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6667e4b1d19d1e21d94ba1b99387ba444b75eb591672508d186a9185aba46660", "ja": "それを言うなら期待な。\nんっふっふっふ～……ごめん、やっぱ今のナシで。", "zh": "要这么说的话，是“期待”啦。\n嗯呵呵呵呵～……抱歉，刚才那句还是当我没说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "943f1d2f5a60e26ce58610fa4988671d3a3f204f7b23873766cca748a455722c", "ja": "おやおや兄ちゃん、照れがありますな～？\nほらほら、もう一回！　もう一回！", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，哥哥这是害羞了吗～？\n来嘛来嘛，再来一次！再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "30b8e8bc7cd19b81745740d2247f270d5a965c42569b9e33733916a7abd2dab6", "ja": "（みんなのおかげで、どうにか回っている……\n本当に、ありがたい限りだな）", "zh": "（多亏了大家，总算还能正常运转……真是感激不尽啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
